  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a138632f57ee64a7d83953a771e7398c, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "\u0110\u1ED1i ch\u1EE9ng tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i kh\xF4: bi l\u1EA1i
    n\u1EB1m v\u1EC1 m\u1EB7t th\u1EA5p; kh\xF4ng gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u v\u1EADt l\xFD
    m\u1EDBi sau hai ch\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\u1EA5t l\u1ECFng. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P02 trong
    m\u1ED9t v\u1ECF ph\xF9 \u0111i\xEAu P15 \u2014 m\xF4i tr\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4,
    m\u1ED9t v\u1EADt c\u1EA3n v\xE0 tuy\u1EBFn r\u1EA5t ng\u1EAFn.\nRecovery: S\xE2n
    m\u1EDF, l\u1ED7 d\u1EC5 ti\u1EBFp c\u1EADn; b\u1ED1 c\u1EE5c kh\xF4ng d\xF9ng
    qu\xE1n t\xEDnh b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD \u0111\u1EC3 ph\u1EA1t th\xF3i quen v\u1EEBa
    h\u1ECDc"
